9 0 obj
<< /Length 297 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (PURPOSE) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 724 Td (This synthetic guideline addresses pharmacologic therapy for adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 708 Td (Version 2.0 supersedes Version 1.0. Where recommendations conflict, Version 2.0 is authoritative.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Length 664 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (CLINICAL MANAGEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 724 Td (First-line pharmacologic therapy for adults with type 2 diabetes is metformin unless contraindicated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 708 Td (If metformin is contraindicated or not tolerated, clinicians should use an alternative agent supported) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 692 Td (by this guideline rather than reverting to superseded Version 1.0 sulfonylurea-first language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 676 Td (Lifestyle counseling should accompany pharmacologic therapy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 660 Td (This guideline does not authorize autonomous diagnosis or autonomous prescribing.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
11 0 obj
<< /Length 232 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (MONITORING) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 724 Td (Reassess glycemic control after metformin initiation according to this guideline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 708 Td (Monitor renal function when metformin is used.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
12 0 obj
<< /Length 180 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (LIMITATIONS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 724 Td (This document is synthetic evaluation content. It contains no real patient data and is not medical advice.) Tj ET
endstream
